<section id="About" class="container mx-auto mb-28 p-6">
    <h2 class="heading text-5xl md:text-9xl uppercase">About me</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 items-center md:p-0 gap-8">
        <div class="space-y-6"><div class="w-full aspect-[668/516] md:max-w-[668px] overflow-hidden rounded-3xl"><img src="/cheyenne-kuckein.webp" alt="Cheyenne Kuckein" class="w-full h-full object-cover" /></div></div>
        <div>
            <div class="text-lg md:text-2xl text-secondary space-y-4">
                <p>Hello! I'm Cheyenne, a bilingual Product Marketing professional from Vancouver, Canada, currently living my best life in Chamonix. I bring 7+ years of marketing experience across management, consulting, and Product Marketing roles in tech, insurance, energy, and e-commerce. As a native English speaker fluent in French, I do my best work bridging French product, marketing and sales teams with English-speaking markets.</p>
                <p>France has long felt like a second home, shaped by several study, volunteer, and exchange experiences growing up. In 2025, what was meant to be a short six-month sabbatical working in the Alps changed everything. I felt more alive and challenged here than anywhere else. So, I followed my intuition, leaving British Columbia's mountains for new summits and career opportunities in France.</p>
                <p>Outside of work, you'll most likely find me outdoors: hiking, cycling, or playing soccer. On rainy days, I'm usually cozying up with a hot cup of tea (Lapsang Souchong, anyone?) while learning something new. My creative rotation evolves constantly, but language learning and multimedia art, like drawing and sewing, are my constants.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h3 class="heading text-2xl uppercase my-8 text-secondary">My Skills</h3>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 mt-8">
                    {['GTM Strategy', 'Positioning', 'Market & User Research', 'Sales Enablement', 'AI Workflows', 'Lifecycle Marketing'].map((skill) => <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-4xl py-4 px-8 font-plex font-bold uppercase tracking-[-2%] outline-1 outline-dashed outline-secondary">{skill}</span>)}
                </div>
                <h3 class="heading text-2xl uppercase my-8 text-secondary">Languages</h3>
                <div class="space-y-3">
                    {[
                        { language: 'English', level: 'Native', progress: 5 },
                        { language: 'French', level: 'Professional working proficiency', progress: 4 },
                        { language: 'Spanish', level: 'Beginner', progress: 1 },
                    ].map(({ language, level, progress }) => (
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-5 rounded-2xl border border-secondary/20 p-4">
                            <div class="min-w-0">
                                <p class="font-plex font-bold uppercase tracking-[-2%]">{language}</p>
                                <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-secondary">{level}</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex h-12 shrink-0 items-end gap-1.5" role="img" aria-label={`${language} proficiency visualization, ${progress} of 5`}>
                                {[12, 20, 28, 38, 48].map((height, index) => (
                                    <span class={`w-2.5 rounded-full ${index < progress ? 'bg-primary' : 'bg-secondary/20'}`} style={`height:${height}px`}></span>
                                ))}
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    ))}
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

